        {
          "id": "/page/10/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Pound the veal chops. Make a few short cuts on the edges to prevent curling, salt them on both sides. Dip each in milk, dredge in flour shaking off excess, then dip in beaten eggs and coat with bread crumbs.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              570.0,
              771.75
            ],
            [
              1351.5,
              771.75
            ],
            [
              1351.5,
