          "images": null
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/11/SectionHeader/6",
          "block_type": "SectionHeader",
          "html": "<h2>Veal goulash - Guláš telecí</h2>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              549.0,
              506.0
            ],
            [
              912.0,
              506.0
            ],
            [
              912.0,
              539.0000000000001
            ],
            [
              549.0,
              539.0000000000001
            ]
          ],
          "bbox": [
            549.0,
            506.0,
            912.0,
            539.0000000000001
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "2": "/page/11/SectionHeader/6"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/11/ListGroup/7",
          "block_type": "ListGroup",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>• 3 lbs. boneless veal shoulder, cut in 1\" cubes</li>\n<li>• 6 tablespoons butter</li>\n<li>• 1 medium onion, finely chopped</li>\n<li>• 2 tablespoons paprika</li>\n<li>• dash of hot curry powder</li>\n<li>• 2 cups chicken broth</li>\n<li>• juice of 1 lemon</li>\n<li>• 4 tablespoons flour</li>\n<li>• 1 pint heavy cream</li>\n<li>• salt and pepper</li>\n</ul>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              121.5,
              559.0
            ],
            [
              514.5,
              559.0
            ],
            [
              514.5,
              809.0
            ],
            [
              121.5,
              809.0
            ]
          ],
          "bbox": [
            121.5,
            559.0,
            514.5,
            809.0
          ],
          "children": [],
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "2": "/page/11/SectionHeader/6"
          },
          "images": null
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/11/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Melt butter in a heavy 3 quart saucepan. Add onion and cook over medium heat until translucent. Add paprika, curry, veal, 2-3 tablespoons chicken broth.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              549.0,
              555.0000000000001
            ],
            [
              1324.5,
              555.0000000000001
            ],
            [
              1324.5,
              634.0
            ],
            [
              549.0,
              634.0
            ]
          ],
          "bbox": [
            549.0,
            555.0000000000001,
            1324.5,
            634.0
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "2": "/page/11/SectionHeader/6"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/11/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Simmer over low heat about 1 hr. adding gradually chicken broth, if needed. The meat must be simmering in just enough liquid so that it does not stick to the pot. You may not use up all of the chicken broth. When the veal is tender, not overcooked, add lemon juice. Mix well flour and cream and blend the mixture into the stew. Bring to boil, simmer 5 minutes, stirring often. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              549.0,
              635.0
            ],
            [
              1344.0,
              635.0
            ],
            [
              1344.0,
              823.0
