        {
          "id": "/page/12/ListGroup/1",
          "block_type": "ListGroup",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>• 3-4 lbs. center cut pork roast – (ask the butcher to saw across the rib bones of the roast, at the base of the backbone – separating the ribs from the backbone. It will ease the carving).</li>\n<li>• 2 cups chicken stock</li>\n<li>• 2 teaspoons caraway seeds</li>\n<li>• 3 cloves garlic, pressed</li>\n<li>• 2 bay leaves</li>\n<li>• salt and pepper</li>\n</ul>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              117.0,
              189.0
            ],
            [
              519.0,
              189.0
            ],
