        {
          "id": "/page/12/Text/14",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Set over medium heat. Add the meat and brown it lightly on all sides. Lower the heat, cover tightly and simmer over low heat until tender, about 2 hours, gradually adding the chicken stock or water.</p>",
